# Final Fantasy Tactics (USA): cold BIOS boot to the Orbonne Monastery tutorial battle.
# Frames are VBLANK counts (sched.c). Timings are tuned to this core.
#
#   ./_out/jonboy --boot --bios <retail bios> \
#       --cd "Final Fantasy Tactics (USA).cue" \
#       --script assets/fft_tutorial_battle.script --steps 3950000000
#
# Sequence: three Cross taps pick NEW GAME off the title menu; START taps skip
# the opening cutscene to the name-entry screen; Circle accepts the default name
# "Ramza"; then alternating START/Circle skips the remaining cutscenes and accepts
# each confirm popup (birthday, dialogue) into the tutorial battle map. FFT uses
# Circle to confirm and Cross to cancel in its in-game dialogs.
#
